The '''Nogratu''' was a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]]. The [[Fourth Sister]], who was a Force-sensitive female member of the species and was an Inquisitor during the [[Imperial Era]], was from the [[Ehosiq sector]].<ref name="Encyclopedia">''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia: The Comprehensive Guide to the Star Wars Galaxy]]''</ref>

{{Species-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Nogratu, albeit unidentified, first appeared in the [[Part II|second episode]] of the [[Disney+]] live-action series ''[[Star Wars: Obi-Wan Kenobi]]'',<ref name="O-WK II" /> which aired on [[May 26]], [[2022]].<ref name="Episode 2 Premiere">{{Twitter|obiwankenobi|status/1530019678562549760|''[[Star Wars: Obi-Wan Kenobi]]''|date=2022-05-26|quote=The time for #ObiWanKenobi has arrived&hellip;early. Start streaming the first two episodes on @DisneyPlus TONIGHT at 9PM PT.|archivedate=20220527053945}}</ref> The species later got identified in the [[2024]] [[Dorling Kindersley]] reference book ''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia: The Comprehensive Guide to the Star Wars Galaxy]]'', which was authored by [[Dan Brooks]], [[Megan Crouse]], [[Amy Richau]], [[Amy Ratcliffe]], [[Brandon Wainerdi]], [[Dan Zehr]], and [[Kelly Knox]].<ref name="Encyclopedia" />

